NAME
       lspci - list the PCI devices of the machine

SYNOPSIS
       lspci

DESCRIPTION
       lspci prints one line per device on the PCI bus: its address, its
       class (Ethernet controller, VGA compatible controller, SCSI storage
       controller...) and its maker and model. On a virtual machine you will
       see virtual hardware such as Red Hat's Virtio devices. It is in the
       pciutils package.

EXAMPLES
           lspci | grep -i ethernet

SEE ALSO
       lsblk(8), lscpu(1), lsmod(8)
